  <FileName>k__BackingField: Q2PNJ2
  <Groups>k__BackingField: []
  <Nodes>k__BackingField:
  - <ID>k__BackingField: 68634a1c-9c3b-4c6f-996a-ea37da17bb30
    <Name>k__BackingField: Global6
    <Text>k__BackingField: Excuse me, I'm very happy to meet one of the few friends
      that my master has been able to have in his long life.
    <Choices>k__BackingField:
    - <NodeID>k__BackingField: fa28122b-14e2-4566-891b-b584bdc78124
      <RequiredFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <RequiredFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      <OnChosenFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <OnChosenFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      _text: Next Dialogue
    <GroupID>k__BackingField: 
    <DialogueType>k__BackingField: 0
    <Position>k__BackingField: {x: -104, y: 734.39996}
    <ActorName>k__BackingField: You
  - <ID>k__BackingField: 48924879-1825-40ec-b666-caaac02c29bb
    <Name>k__BackingField: Global3
    <Text>k__BackingField: It reassures me because even the elves do not live forever
      and the weight of years began to be read on his face and in his actions.
    <Choices>k__BackingField:
    - <NodeID>k__BackingField: 6c840a4c-d474-462e-8774-7a9f37e9905d
      <RequiredFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <RequiredFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      <OnChosenFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <OnChosenFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      _text: Were you close with Mr. Kemlhos ?
    - <NodeID>k__BackingField: 6c840a4c-d474-462e-8774-7a9f37e9905d
      <RequiredFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <RequiredFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      <OnChosenFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <OnChosenFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      _text: How do you know it was an elf ?
    <GroupID>k__BackingField: 
    <DialogueType>k__BackingField: 1
    <Position>k__BackingField: {x: -99.2, y: 380.80002}
    <ActorName>k__BackingField: Ashkaya
  - <ID>k__BackingField: fa28122b-14e2-4566-891b-b584bdc78124
    <Name>k__BackingField: Gloabl7
    <Text>k__BackingField: He often told me about you, but unlike him, I am not an
      elf and I have to hurry to continue his research because I do not have the
      longevity of an elf. Could you tell me where his house was ?
    <Choices>k__BackingField:
    - <NodeID>k__BackingField: df0ba8b1-5991-4df3-8956-4c72f8eddf07
      <RequiredFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <RequiredFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      <OnChosenFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <OnChosenFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      _text: Next Dialogue
    <GroupID>k__BackingField: 
    <DialogueType>k__BackingField: 0
    <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 704.8, y: 732.8}
    <ActorName>k__BackingField: You
  - <ID>k__BackingField: df0ba8b1-5991-4df3-8956-4c72f8eddf07
    <Name>k__BackingField: Global8
    <Text>k__BackingField: Yes, of course. This wise elf has always had the rather
      absurd habit of placing himself at the northwest end of the villages in which
      he lived.
    <Choices>k__BackingField:
    - <NodeID>k__BackingField: 
      <RequiredFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <RequiredFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      <OnChosenFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <OnChosenFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      _text: Next Dialogue
    <GroupID>k__BackingField: 
    <DialogueType>k__BackingField: 0
    <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 1794.4, y: 734.39996}
    <ActorName>k__BackingField: Ashkaya
  - <ID>k__BackingField: 6c840a4c-d474-462e-8774-7a9f37e9905d
    <Name>k__BackingField: Global4
    <Text>k__BackingField: Well, despite the fact that we only stayed for about ten
      years, we still had the opportunity to get to know each other during our village
      festivals.
    <Choices>k__BackingField:
    - <NodeID>k__BackingField: e9e589af-4fd7-4c52-8ae9-64f181319f0b
      <RequiredFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <RequiredFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      <OnChosenFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <OnChosenFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      _text: Next Dialogue
    <GroupID>k__BackingField: 
    <DialogueType>k__BackingField: 0
    <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 703.2, y: 414.4}
    <ActorName>k__BackingField: Ashkaya
  - <ID>k__BackingField: e9e589af-4fd7-4c52-8ae9-64f181319f0b
    <Name>k__BackingField: Gloabl5
    <Text>k__BackingField: "And then he gave me his trust and told me that he was
      one of the rare elves still alive and that it\u2019s to avoid problems that
      he hid it.\r"
    <Choices>k__BackingField:
    - <NodeID>k__BackingField: 68634a1c-9c3b-4c6f-996a-ea37da17bb30
      <RequiredFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <RequiredFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      <OnChosenFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <OnChosenFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      _text: Next Dialogue
    <GroupID>k__BackingField: 
    <DialogueType>k__BackingField: 0
    <Position>k__BackingField: {x: 1580.8, y: 414.4}
    <ActorName>k__BackingField: Ashkaya
  - <ID>k__BackingField: c5e92d17-2e35-4036-a8ab-b7794d1cf374
    <Name>k__BackingField: Global2Bis
    <Text>k__BackingField: "Yes, it\u2019s really me, so old Kemlhos has finally
      found a disciple to take up the torch..."
    <Choices>k__BackingField:
    - <NodeID>k__BackingField: 48924879-1825-40ec-b666-caaac02c29bb
      <RequiredFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <RequiredFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      <OnChosenFlag>k__BackingField: 
      <OnChosenFlagValue>k__BackingField: 0
      _text: Next Dialogue
    <GroupID>k__BackingField: 
    <DialogueType>k__BackingField: 0
    <Position>k__BackingField: {x: -780, y: 226.40001}
    <ActorName>k__BackingField: Ashkaya
  - <ID>k__BackingField: e3e949c5-4970-4903-a6e8-eda6e8af4b20
    <Name>k__BackingField: Global1Bis
    <Text>k__BackingField: "Hello ! Are you really Ashkaya ? I came to explore this
      village to find old works by my master, Chrolse Kemlhos. Could you tell me
      where he lived ?\r"
    <Choices>k__BackingField:
    - <NodeID>k__BackingField: c5e92d17-2e35-4036-a8ab-b7794d1cf374
